---
description: Working or creating database migrations
alwaysApply: false
---
Migrations should be created using the `mikro-orm` CLI, after modifying any entity file.

```bash
cd apps/api
pnpm db:migrate:create
```

Never write a migration file from scratch. Run `pnpm db:migrate:check` before touching an entity: it must report no changes. If it does, or if a generated migration holds changes unrelated to your entities, the snapshot has drifted: stop and say so instead of trimming the file. See "Migrations" in the backend guidelines.
